355	/**
356	 * Return the DNS records a customer must publish at their registrar for an
357	 * EXTERNAL domain so mail flows through the Nxeon mail server, plus the
358	 * ownership-verification record. Ownership-checked (caller must own the sub).
359	 *
360	 * The DKIM record is fetched from Mailcow (`mcGetDkim`) and cached in
361	 * `dkimRecord`; when Mailcow isn't configured (or has no key yet) a placeholder
362	 * note is returned so the panel still renders.
