865	/**
866	 * Generate a new strong password for a mailbox the caller owns, apply it on the
867	 * mail server (Mailcow), then persist the new encrypted value. Owner-only and
868	 * rate-limited. The mail-server call must succeed before we store the new value,
869	 * so a stored password always matches what actually authenticates. Returns the
870	 * new password once for the customer to copy.
